<title>UK: CE Heath plans share repurchase programme.</title>
<headline>CE Heath plans share repurchase programme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance broker C.E. Heath Plc said on Wednesday it intends to buy up to, but not more than, five percent of the issued share capital of the company, or around 3.4 million ordinary shares.</p>
</text>
